  "title": "Custom Inspirational Bible Verse Floral Blanket - D5",
  "handle": "custom-inspirational-bible-verse-floral-blanket-d5",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace faith and comfort with our Custom Bible Verse Christian Blanket, designed to bring warmth and daily encouragement into your home. This personalized blanket is a heartfelt gift, perfect for believers who cherish inspiration and faith-filled living, making it an ideal companion for prayer and quiet reflection.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational religious throw blanket, perfect for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms for women and girls.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name or date to create a unique keepsake, celebrating faith and cherishing special moments.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with skin-friendly fabric and uplifting verses, providing warmth and peace for quiet time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a modern design with butterflies, floral, cloud, and cross patterns.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Offers two text input options for personalization.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
